      <td style="width:100%;padding:8px 8px 8px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#475569;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;line-height:1.4;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><a href="https://x.test/RI/2026/HB 1234" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Marguerite Okonkwo: &quot;Free IDs sound simple, but our office would need a second workstation and staff coverage to issue them during peak weeks…&quot;</a></td>
      <td align="right" style="padding:8px 14px 8px 0;font-size:12px;color:#667386;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Jun 10</td>
